    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25888" root="ضغن" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُضَاغِنٌ</span></b>  One <i>who treats,</i> or <i>regards, his brother
with rancour, malevolence, malice,</i> or <i>spite,</i> or
<i>with enmity, being so regarded,</i> or <i>treated, by
him;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُضْطَغِنٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

